                <note rend="inline" type="source">738.39/281: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Mayer</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-01-22T14:00:00-05:00">January 22, 1938—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 3:10 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>24. My telegram No. 23, January 22, 1 p.m. Am informed full accord reached here.
                    Repeated to Santo Domingo.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mayer</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
